• Understanding state of Azure, Google and AWS components and reference architectures;

Experience in designing for Bigdata/data warehousing/business intelligence/reporting solutions for various physical environments, both on-premises as well as in the Microsoft cloud, while influencing for the most efficient approach based on business requirements;

